[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-classical-bd3 5...Qxd4"]
[Name "Classical: 5.Bd3 Qxd4 6.Be3"]

6. Be3 Qd8 { Steps back to safety. 6...Qxb2 grabs a second pawn, but it sends the queen a long way from home. }
7. Qe2 Bxe4 { Swaps pieces, the plan of anyone a pawn up. }
8. Bxe4 Nf6 { Hits the bishop with a developing move. } *
